    {
      "key": "Nguyen2026Replication",
      "orcidType": "software",
      "title": "Replication package for \"p-Hacking and Publication Bias in Design-Based Causal Studies in Information Systems\"",
      "abstract": "Data and code that reproduce every table and figure in \"p-Hacking and Publication Bias in Design-Based Causal Studies in Information Systems\" (Information Systems Research, 2026). The package contains 7,516 hand-coded statistical tests from 558 articles published 2000-2023 in seven leading information systems journals, covering difference-in-differences, instrumental variables, randomized controlled trials, regression discontinuity and synthetic control designs, plus the R code for the z-curve, randomization, caliper, local false discovery rate and weak-instrument analyses.",
